                                       ],\n                                                    "comment": " 消息标题"\n                                                },\n                                                "extras": {\n                                                    "notnull": false,\n                                                    "type": "object",\n                                                    "valueLevel": 0,\n                                                    "values": [\n                                                        {\n                                                            "key": {\n                                                                "notnull": true,\n                                                                "type": "string",\n                                                                "valueLevel": 3,\n                                                                "values": [],\n                                                                "lengthLevel": 1,\n                                                                "lengths": [\n                                                                    5\n                                                                ]\n                                                            }\n                                                        }\n                                                    ],\n                                                    "comment": " JSON 格式的可选参数"\n                                                }\n                                            }\n                                        ],\n                                        "comment": "Object, 消息内容体，是被推送到客户端的内容。与 notification 一起二者必须有其一，二者不可以并存。"\n                                    },\n                                    "options": {\n                                        "notnull": false,\n                                        "type": "object",\n                                        "valueLevel": 0,\n                                        "values": [\n                                            {\n                                                "time_to_live": {\n                                                    "notnull": false,\n                                                    "type": "integer",\n                                                    "valueLevel": 0,\n                                                    "values": [\n                                                        60\n                                                    ],\n                                                    "lengthLevel": 1,\n                                                    "lengths": [\n                                                        2\n                                                    ],\n                                                    "repeat": 8,\n                                                    "trend": {\n                                                        "top": 4\n                                                    },\n                                                    "comment": " Int 或 String，离线消息保留时长(秒)：若推送时用户不在线，可为该用户保留指定时长的离线消息，以便其上线时再次推送。默认 86400 （1 天），最长 15 天，若厂商支持的最大值 < 传递的有效值，则以厂商最大值为准。设置为 0 表示不保留离线消息，只有推送当前在线的用户可以收到。"\n                                                },\n                                                "apns_production": {\n                                                    "notnull": false,\n                                                    "type": "boolean",\n                                                    "valueLevel": 0,\n                                                    "values": [\n                                                        false\n                                                    ],\n                                                    "lengthLevel": 1,\n                                                    "lengths": [],\n                       